  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "14",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EZK 14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "14",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then came certain of the elders of Israel unto me, and sat before me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the word of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.14.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.14.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "came unto me, saying,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Son of man, these men have set up their idols in their heart, and put the stumblingblock of their iniquity before their face: should I be enquired of at all by them?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore speak unto them, and say unto them, Thus saith the Lord",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "GOD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.14.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.14.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; Every man of the house of Israel that setteth up his idols in his heart, and putteth the stumblingblock of his iniquity before his face, and cometh to the prophet; I the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.14.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.14.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "will answer him that cometh according to the multitude of his idols;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "That I may take the house of Israel in their own heart, because they are all estranged from me through their idols.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Therefore say unto the house of Israel, Thus saith the Lord",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "GOD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.14.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.14.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; Repent, and turn",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "yourselves",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.14.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.14.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "from your idols; and turn away your faces from all your abominations.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For every one of the house of Israel, or of the stranger that sojourneth in Israel, which separateth himself from me, and setteth up his idols in his heart, and putteth the stumblingblock of his iniquity before his face, and cometh to a prophet to enquire of him concerning me; I the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.14.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.14.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "will answer him by myself:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will set my face against that man, and will make him a sign and a proverb, and I will cut him off from the midst of my people; and ye shall know that I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.14.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.14.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.14.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.14.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And if the prophet be deceived when he hath spoken a thing, I the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.14.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.14.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "have deceived that prophet, and I will stretch out my hand upon him, and will destroy him from the midst of my people Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they shall bear the punishment of their iniquity: the punishment of the prophet shall be even as the punishment of him that seeketh",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "unto him;",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.14.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.14.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "That the house of Israel may go no more astray from me, neither be polluted any more with all their transgressions; but that they may be my people, and I may be their God, saith the Lord",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "GOD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.14.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.14.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ The word of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.14.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.14.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "came again to me, saying,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Son of man, when the land sinneth against me by trespassing grievously, then will I stretch out mine hand upon it, and will break the staff of the bread thereof, and will send famine upon it, and will cut off man and beast from it:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Though these three men, Noah, Daniel, and Job, were in it, they should deliver",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "but",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.14.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.14.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "their own souls by their righteousness, saith the Lord",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "GOD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.14.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.14.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ If I cause noisome beasts to pass through the land, and they spoil it, so that it be desolate, that no man may pass through because of the beasts:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Though",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.14.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.14.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "these three men",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "were",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.14.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.14.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in it,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "as",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.14.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.14.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I live, saith the Lord",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "GOD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.14.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.14.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", they shall deliver neither sons nor daughters; they only shall be delivered, but the land shall be desolate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Or",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "if",
